{"id":"vod_md_5991","vodId":"5991","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"一拳超人","name_cn":"一拳超人","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231015-1/5ab3e5d0ccf41eae336a5bed1cfc6e08.jpg"},"summary":"曾经，埼玉（古川慎 配音）只是一介平凡的上班族，某日，在偶然之中遇见了遭到变种螃蟹攻击的少年，心中升腾起了正义之感，对其出手相救。就此之后，埼玉幼年时代的英雄梦想在内心里死灰复燃，为了变得更加强大，埼玉开始了艰苦的训练，一晃眼数年过去，他仿佛脱胎换骨般的获得了异常强大的力量，但却付出了变成光头的代价。由于埼玉的力量实在是过于强大，无论面对如何可怕的敌人，都只需一拳就能分出胜负。之后，埼玉遇见了名为杰诺斯（石川界人 配音）的改造人，后者在领略了埼玉的绝对强大之后拜其为师。与此同时，埼玉和杰诺斯报名加入了英雄协会，成为了真真正正有名有号的英雄，就此开始了打击罪恶之旅。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-15 08:07:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/EJ6Y8EtU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/V4I1EV4K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/4faoKmbx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/WfZk1cNm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/LKfmhEAk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/VqJTXj6k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/7MuA4P2Q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/FzePKQvO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/9hWlkr8x/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/pSlku0zL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/PkTmgMTh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/89KtAx2Z/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:03.827Z"}